---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service | Micro Signal Cosmos"
  description="Terms of Service governing your access and reading of the Micro Signal Cosmos digital publication."
>
  <Header />

  <main id="main-content" class="bg-[#0B0F19] py-16 sm:py-24">
    <div class="container-main">

      <!-- Header Section -->
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
        <div class="mb-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-sky-400/20 bg-sky-400/5 px-4 py-2">
          <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-[#00D2FF]"></span>
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider text-sky-300 uppercase">
            User Agreement
          </span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-5xl">
          Terms of <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-sky-400 via-blue-400 to-purple-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent">Service</span>
        </h1>

        <p class="mt-4 text-xs font-medium text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest">
          Effective Date: November 2026 &bull; Last Revised: November 2026
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Content Article -->
      <article class="mx-auto mt-14 max-w-3xl rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-[#151C2E] p-8 sm:p-12 text-sm leading-8 text-slate-300 space-y-8">

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-slate-400">
            By accessing, reading, or navigating <strong class="text-white">Micro Signal Cosmos</strong> ("the Website," "the Publication"), you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agreed to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree with any part of these terms, please discontinue use of the Website.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="border-t border-white/10 pt-8">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">2. Intellectual Property & Copyright</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-slate-400">
            All original editorial articles, research summaries, editorial visual artwork, branding marks, layout arrangements, and code presented on Micro Signal Cosmos are the proprietary property of Micro Signal Cosmos or its content creators and are protected by applicable copyright, trademark, and intellectual property laws.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3 text-slate-400">
            <strong class="text-white">Permitted Citation:</strong> You are encouraged to quote short excerpts (up to 150 words) from our articles for educational, commentary, or news purposes, provided that you provide clear attribution and a direct hyperlink back to the original Micro Signal Cosmos article URL. Mass syndication, full-article republication, or unauthorized commercial reproduction is strictly prohibited without prior written consent.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="border-t border-white/10 pt-8">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">3. Reader Conduct & Permissible Use</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-slate-400">
            When interacting with our publication, readers agree not to:
          </p>
          <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 text-slate-400">
            <li>Engage in automated scraping, harvesting, or systematic extraction that burdens our server infrastructure.</li>
            <li>Attempt to bypass, disable, or tamper with security protocols or server firewalls.</li>
            <li>Submit fraudulent, abusive, defamatory, or unlawful communications through our contact channels.</li>
            <li>Misrepresent an affiliation with Micro Signal Cosmos or its editorial staff.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="border-t border-white/10 pt-8">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">4. Informational & Educational Scope</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-slate-400">
            Micro Signal Cosmos is an independent technology, science, and digital literacy publication. Content published across our categories—including artificial intelligence tutorials, software overviews, and scientific analyses—is provided solely for general educational, exploratory, and informational purposes. Please review our complete <a href="/disclaimer/" class="text-sky-400 underline hover:text-sky-300">Disclaimer</a> for detailed professional limitations.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="border-t border-white/10 pt-8">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">5. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-slate-400">
            The website and all materials therein are provided on an "as is" and "as available" basis without warranties of any kind, whether express, statutory, or implied. While we strive for meticulous editorial accuracy, we make no guarantees that content will be uninterrupted, error-free, or continuously up-to-date with rapid technological changes.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="border-t border-white/10 pt-8">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">6. Limitation of Liability</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-slate-400">
            To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, Micro Signal Cosmos, its editors, authors, and contributors shall not be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, consequential, or punitive damages arising from your access to, use of, or reliance upon any information or technical guides provided on this publication.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="border-t border-white/10 pt-8">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">7. Governing Law & Jurisdiction</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-slate-400">
            These Terms shall be interpreted and governed in accordance with applicable electronic publishing laws and standards, without regard to conflict of law provisions. Any dispute arising from these terms shall be resolved in a court of competent jurisdiction.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="border-t border-white/10 pt-8">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">8. Inquiries & Contact</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-slate-400">
            If you have questions regarding these Terms of Service or wish to request licensing permissions, please contact our legal desk:
          </p>
          <div class="mt-4 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-[#0B0F19] p-5 text-xs text-slate-400 space-y-1">
            <p><strong class="text-white">Publication:</strong> Micro Signal Cosmos (Independent Digital Publication)</p>
            <p><strong class="text-white">Legal Inquiries:</strong> legal@microsignalcosmos.com</p>
            <p><strong class="text-white">Operations:</strong> Digital-first editorial network</p>
            <p><strong class="text-white">Reader Communications:</strong> Available through our official <a href="/contact/" class="text-sky-400 underline hover:text-sky-300">Contact Desk</a></p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </article>

    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>

